{"document_id": 188, "sha256": "3f227b2ea870652c33cf70e8387f119e4cba92eb5832b539f987a3211b0016a7", "agency": "fda", "doc_type": "approval_letter", "program_id": "CT-P43", "engine": "prep-1.4+docling2.137.0+tables-accurate+repair1+pictables1", "watermarks_removed": 0, "routes": [{"page": 1, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=1429"}, {"page": 2, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=2724"}, {"page": 3, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=2194"}, {"page": 4, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=697"}, {"page": 5, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=573"}], "blocks": [{"type": "picture", "ref": "#/pictures/0", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [71.0, 720.1, 264.1, 756.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "caption": "", "text": "", "status": "kept", "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/0", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 671.2, 173.5, 682.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "BLA 761338/S-007", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/1", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 547.0, 228.2, 641.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "CELLTRION, Inc. c/o Parexel International Attention: Ally Danta Regulatory Affairs Consultant 541 Church at North Hills St. Suite 1000 Raleigh, NC 27609", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/2", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 491.8, 159.5, 503.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Dear Ally Danta:", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/3", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 436.6, 529.7, 475.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Please refer to your supplemental biologics license application (sBLA) received July 7, 2025, and your amendments, submitted under section 351(k) of the Public Health Service Act for Steqeyma (ustekinumab-stba) Injection.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/4", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 395.2, 429.1, 406.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "This Prior Approval supplemental biologics application provides for:", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/5", "parent": "#/groups/0", "page": 1, "bbox": [90.0, 366.8, 509.1, 391.9], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "list_item", "text": "branded labeling to align with labeling approved for Stelara on November 3, 2025.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/6", "parent": "#/groups/0", "page": 1, "bbox": [90.0, 338.5, 539.7, 363.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "list_item", "text": "unbranded biological product labeling for Ustekinumab-stba 45 mg/0.5 mL singledose vial (SDV) for subcutaneous use.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/7", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 296.7, 215.4, 308.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "APPROVAL & LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["APPROVAL & LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/8", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 241.9, 535.6, 280.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We have completed our review of this application, as amended. It is approved, effective on the date of this letter, for use as recommended in the enclosed agreed-upon labeling.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["APPROVAL & LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/9", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 200.1, 214.7, 211.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "CONTENT OF LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/10", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 131.5, 533.3, 184.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "As soon as possible, but no later than 14 days from the date of this letter, submit, via the FDA automated drug registration and listing system (eLIST), the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.14(b)] in structured product labeling (SPL) format, as described at FDA.gov, 1 that is identical to the enclosed labeling (text for the Prescribing Information,", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/11", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 83.5, 456.8, 93.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "footnote", "text": "1 http://www.fda.gov/ForIndustry/DataStandards/StructuredProductLabeling/default.htm", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/12", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [388.0, 657.1, 540.0, 668.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/13", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [10.0, 8.3, 92.7, 15.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 5710950", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/14", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 742.0, 173.5, 753.3], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 761338/S-007", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/15", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 728.2, 110.1, 739.5], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "Page 2", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/16", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 649.9, 534.3, 702.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Instructions for Use, and Medication Guide) and include the labeling changes proposed in any pending \"Changes Being Effected\" (CBE) supplements. Information on submitting SPL files using eLIST may be found in the guidance for industry SPL Standard for Content of Labeling Technical Qs and As. 2", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/17", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 622.4, 441.0, 633.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "The SPL will be accessible via publicly available labeling repositories.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/18", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 498.3, 539.0, 606.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Also within 14 days, amend all pending supplemental applications that include labeling changes for this BLA, including pending \"Changes Being Effected\" (CBE) supplements, for which FDA has not yet issued an action letter, with the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.12(f)] in Microsoft Word format that includes the changes approved in this supplemental application, as well as annual reportable changes. To facilitate review of your submission(s), provide a highlighted or marked-up copy that shows all changes, as well as a clean Microsoft Word version. The marked-up copy should provide appropriate annotations, including supplement number(s) and annual report date(s).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/19", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 456.5, 291.9, 468.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "CARTON AND CONTAINER LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CARTON AND CONTAINER LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/20", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 318.9, 524.4, 440.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Submit final printed carton and container labeling that are identical to the enclosed carton and container labeling, except with the revisions listed above, as soon as they are available, but no more than 30 days after they are printed. Please submit these labeling electronically according to the guidance for industry Providing Regulatory Submissions in Electronic Format - Certain Human Pharmaceutical Product Applications and Related Submissions Using the eCTD Specifications. For administrative purposes, designate this submission \"Final Printed Carton and Container Labeling for approved BLA 761338/S-007.\" Approval of this submission by FDA is not required before the labeling is used.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CARTON AND CONTAINER LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/21", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 277.1, 297.4, 288.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/22", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 180.9, 535.8, 261.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Under the Pediatric Research Equity Act (PREA) (21 U.S.C. 355c), all applications for new active ingredients (which includes new salts and new fixed combinations), new indications, new dosage forms, new dosing regimens, or new routes of administration are required to contain an assessment of the safety and effectiveness of the product for the claimed indication(s) in pediatric patients unless this requirement is waived, deferred, or inapplicable.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/23", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 139.5, 530.4, 164.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "At this time, we have determined that no pediatric studies will be required under PREA for your sBLA.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/24", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 83.4, 534.4, 104.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "footnote", "text": "2 We update guidances periodically. For the most recent version of a guidance, check the FDA Guidance Documents Database https://www.fda.gov/RegulatoryInformation/Guidances/default.htm.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/25", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 58.7, 238.5, 68.3], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "U.S. Food and Drug Administration", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/26", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 47.5, 180.2, 56.8], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Silver Spring, MD 20993", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/27", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 35.6, 133.7, 45.3], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "www.fda.gov", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/28", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [10.0, 8.3, 92.7, 15.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 5710950", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/29", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 742.0, 173.5, 753.3], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 761338/S-007", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/30", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 728.2, 110.1, 739.5], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "Page 3", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/31", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 677.2, 235.3, 688.9], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/32", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 594.7, 522.4, 661.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "You may request advisory comments on proposed introductory advertising and promotional labeling. For information about submitting promotional materials, see the final guidance for industry Providing Regulatory Submissions in Electronic and NonElectronic Format-Promotional Labeling and Advertising Materials for Human Prescription Drugs. 3", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/33", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 525.8, 533.2, 578.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "You must submit final promotional materials and Prescribing Information, accompanied by a Form FDA 2253, at the time of initial dissemination or publication [21 CFR 601.12(f)(4)]. Form FDA 2253 is available at FDA.gov. 4 Information and Instructions for completing the form can be found at FDA.gov. 5", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/34", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 401.7, 531.1, 495.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "All promotional materials that include representations about your drug product must be promptly revised to be consistent with the labeling changes approved in this supplement, including any new safety-related information [21 CFR 601.12(f)(4)]. The revisions in your promotional materials should include prominent disclosure of the important new safety-related information that appears in the revised labeling. Within 7 days of receipt of this letter, submit your statement of intent to comply with 21 CFR 601.12(f)(4).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/35", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 359.9, 243.4, 371.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "REPORTING REQUIREMENTS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/36", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 318.9, 531.8, 344.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We remind you that you must comply with reporting requirements for an approved BLA (in 21 CFR 600.80 and in 21 CFR 600.81).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/37", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 249.9, 532.4, 302.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Your product is a Part 3 combination product (21 CFR 3.2(e)); therefore, you must also comply with postmarketing safety reporting requirements for an approved combination product (21 CFR 4, Subpart B). Additional information on combination product postmarketing safety reporting is available at FDA.gov.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/38", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 194.7, 527.8, 219.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "If you have questions, contact Anh-Thy Ly, Project Manager, at 240-402-1001 or AnhThy.Ly@fda.hhs.gov.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/39", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 95.0, 434.5, 116.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "footnote", "text": "3 For the most recent version of a guidance, check the FDA guidance web page at https://www.fda.gov/media/128163/download.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/40", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 83.5, 470.0, 93.4], "layer": "body", "route": 